          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neipot Samson Olaitoriani ajo, “Olaitoriani Enkai, tadamuaki nanu, nikintagol nanu aatasayia ena kata nabo, Na Ai, pee atum aitalaku too Lfilisti nabo oo nkonyek aainei.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neibung nena ng'apeta pokira are apa naatii empolos enkaji, naa ninche apa naairisha e nkaji, neirishakino te ngolon enye pooki shumata ninche, neibung te nkaina enye e tatene nabo ng'ape neibung tene kedienye enkae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Samson, “Ntasho nanu matua te nebo Ilfilisti.” Neirrugo ninye te ngolon enye pooki; neurokino ina aji lelo kituaak o lelo tung'ana pooki apa ootii atua. Neaku ore iltung'ana apa ootuata te keeya enye naa eikumok aalang lelo apa ootasesekuana ninye eton eishu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuonu ilalashera lenyena o lmarei lenye pooki aaya ninye neilepunye ninye aapuonu aanukaa te rishata e Sora o Eshtaol te nkurare e Manoa papaai lenye. Etaa apa ninye olarishani le Israel ilarin tikitam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.31"
            ]
          }
        }
